/* catalog-logo.js: the fixed company logo of Catalog Maker (catalog_maker.html),
   printed on the cover, every product page and the album page.
   It is logo-removebg.png from this folder (transparent background), resized
   to 600 px wide and written here as a data URL. Why not just
   <img src="logo-removebg.png">: the PDF is drawn by html2canvas, and on a
   page opened as file:// a local image counts as another origin, which taints
   the canvas and the PDF export fails. A data URL has no origin, so the logo
   prints the same way everywhere (file://, a web server, and the hidden
   #render frame of Design Master › Online Catalogue).
   To change the logo: replace the PNG and regenerate this file from it
   (any PNG -> base64), keeping the variable name. */
window.SARV_CATALOG_LOGO = 'data:image/png;base64,';